WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:08.000
Once upon a time there was a little&nbsp;
motivated mind. It had many friends,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.840
a stable job and plenty of&nbsp;
good ideas to change the world.

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:17.760
To secure a good life for itself,&nbsp;
the little mind got up early,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:21.840
dressed smartly, picked up that&nbsp;
coffee and arrived first at work.

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:29.600
As time passed, the mind got so good at its&nbsp;
routine that it got up automatically, dressed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:34.400
up blindly, picked up that coffee without thinking&nbsp;
and worked without having to pay much attention.

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:40.480
But then the mind got so good at&nbsp;
it all, that it stopped learning,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:43.840
and as a result got bored, and sick and bitter.

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:49.840
The little mind tried&nbsp;
everything. Expensive clothes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:55.440
fine dining, drugs, therapy, scuba&nbsp;
and skydiving… But nothing worked.

00:00:57.680 --> 00:01:02.480
The little mind kept on losing weight, and&nbsp;
willpower until the day it didn’t get up…&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:06.400
didn’t dress up... didn’t pick up that&nbsp;
coffee... and didn’t show up to work..

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:12.160
It was then when it decided things had to change!&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.160 --> 00:01:16.560
Not all over a sudden, because that&nbsp;
never works, but in small steps.

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:23.600
It started by getting up earlier, just by 5&nbsp;
minutes. It started dressing up differently,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:28.800
but only a bit. It got that coffee, but not&nbsp;
to go and it began working a little less.

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:36.320
With every day that went by, the little mind&nbsp;
got a bit more time — time to try new things,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:41.040
time to talk to strangers, time to work one&nbsp;
some of those crazy ideas to change the world.

00:01:43.280 --> 00:01:48.160
And with every new experience the mind&nbsp;
became stronger. It found a new routine,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.160 --> 00:01:50.640
made new friends, and developed a new passion.

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:58.320
Eventually the little mind even found a soulmate,&nbsp;
made a real family, and started a new job. Every&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:02.880
once in a while, it looks at the fruits of its&nbsp;
labor - one of which is this little story.

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:08.880
From years of research we know that in&nbsp;
order to get through life effectively,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:12.400
we need rigid routines, mental&nbsp;
biases and muscle memory.

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:20.800
However, we also know that to find our passion, to&nbsp;
fall in love, and to make peace with who we are,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:24.160
we sometimes need to slow down and&nbsp;
break the routines we have built.

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:28.800
How about you? Did you change your life,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:33.040
find your true passion and fall in love with&nbsp;
something or someone? Share your thoughts in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:49.840
the comments below. Our little minds are very&nbsp;
much looking forward to reading your story!

